    <section class="ai-alert">⚡ <strong>AI Signals:</strong> 14 assets triggered momentum alerts in the last 60 minutes. Most active sectors: L1, AI, DeFi.</section>

    <section class="panel">
      <div class="table-head">
        <div class="title-row">
          <div>
            <h1>Cryptocurrency Prices by Market Cap</h1>
            <p class="sub">The global crypto market cap is <span class="mono">$2.56T</span>, a <span class="up">1.47%</span> increase over the last day.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="toolbar">
            <button class="btn" id="columnsBtn">Columns ▾</button>
            <button class="btn" id="filtersBtn">Filters ▾</button>
          </div>
