      <div class="pagination" id="pagination"></div>
    </section>

    <section class="two-col">
      <article class="panel summary">
        <h2>Market Summary</h2>
        <p id="summaryText">The global cryptocurrency market cap today is <span class="mono">$2.56T</span>, a <span class="up">1.47%</span> change in the last 24 hours. Total crypto market volume over the last 24 hours is <span class="mono">$156.9B</span>. The total volume in DeFi is currently <span class="mono">$22.75B</span>, <span class="mono">14.51%</span> of the total crypto market 24-hour volume. The volume of all stable coins is now <span class="mono">$92.62B</span>, which is <span class="mono">59.04%</span> of the total crypto market 24-hour volume.</p>
        <button class="more" id="readMoreBtn">Read More</button>
      </article>

      <article class="panel info">
        <h2>About CoinTracker Pro</h2>
        <p>CoinTracker Pro provides real-time prices, historical charts, market capitalization metrics, and liquidity intelligence for digital assets across major blockchain networks.</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Top 100 assets by market cap with full 1h/24h/7d performance.</li>
          <li>Category and chain-aware filtering with fast state transitions.</li>
          <li>Professional number formatting with tabular readability.</li>
        </ul>
      </article>

      <footer class="panel">
        <strong>CoinTracker Pro</strong>
        <div class="footer-links">
          <a href="index.html">Methodology</a>
          <a href="index.html">API</a>
          <a href="index.html">Glossary</a>
          <a href="index.html">Terms</a>
          <a href="index.html">Privacy</a>
        </div>
      </footer>
